  "job_B14.4.5_20251003_114315": {
    "text": "Ic Ine, mid Godes gife Wesseaxna kyning, mid ge\u00f0eahte & mid lare Cenredes mines f\u00e6der & Heddes\n\u00c6rest we bebeoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6tte Godes \u00f0eowas hiora ryhtregol on ryht healdan.\n\u00c6fter \u00feam we bebeoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6tte ealles folces \u00e6w & domas \u00f0us sien gehealdene:\nCild binnan \u00f0ritegum nihta sie gefulwad; gif hit swa ne sie, XXX scillinga gebete.\nGif hit \u00f0onne sie dead butan fulwihte, gebete he hit mid eallum \u00f0am \u00f0e he age.\nGif \u00f0eowmon wyrce on Sunnand\u00e6g be his hlafordes h\u00e6se, sie he frioh, & se hlaford geselle XXX\nGif \u00feonne se \u00f0eowa butan his gewitnesse wyrce, \u00feolie his hyde.\nGif \u00f0onne se frigea \u00f0y d\u00e6ge wyrce butan his hlafordes h\u00e6se, \u00f0olie his freotes.\nCiricsceattas sin agifene be sancte Martines m\u00e6ssan; gif hwa \u00f0\u00e6t ne gel\u00e6ste, sie he scyldig LX scillinga\nGif hwa sie dea\u00f0es scyldig & he cirican geierne, h\u00e6bbe his feorh & bete, swa him ryht wisige.\nGif hwa his hyde forwyrce & cirican geierne, sie him sio swingelle forgifen.\nGif hwa gefeohte on cyninges huse, sie he scyldig ealles his ierfes, & sie on cyninges dome, hw\u00e6\u00f0er he\nGif hwa on mynster gefeohte, CXX scillinga gebete.\nGif hwa on ealdormonnes huse gefeohte o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00f0res ge\u00f0ungenes witan, LX scillinga gebete he &\nGif \u00f0onne on gafolgeldan huse o\u00f0\u00f0e on gebures gefeohte, CXX scillinga to wite geselle & \u00feam gebure\n& \u00feeah hit sie on middum felda gefohten, CXX scillinga to wite sie agifen.\nGif \u00f0onne on gebeorscipe hie geciden, & o\u00f0er hiora mid ge\u00f0ylde hit forbere, geselle se o\u00f0er XXX\nGif hwa stalie, swa his wif nyte & his bearn, geselle LX scillinga to wite.\nGif he \u00f0onne stalie on gewitnesse ealles his hiredes, gongen hie ealle on \u00f0eowot.\nX wintre cniht m\u00e6g bion \u00f0ief\u00f0e gewita.\nGif hwa him ryhtes bidde beforan hwelcum scirmen o\u00f0\u00f0e o\u00ferum deman & abiddan ne m\u00e6ge, & him\nGif hwa wrace do, \u00e6r\u00f0on he him ryhtes bidde, \u00fe\u00e6t he him onnime agife & forgielde & gebete mid XXX\nGif hwa binnan \u00feam gem\u00e6rum ures rices reaflac & niedn\u00e6me do, agife he \u00f0one reaflac & geselle LX\nGif hwa his agenne geleod bebycgge, \u00f0eowne o\u00f0\u00f0e frigne, \u00f0eah he scyldig sie, ofer s\u00e6, forgielde hine\nGif \u00f0eof sie gefongen, swelte he dea\u00f0e, o\u00f0\u00f0e his lif be his were man aliese.\nGif hwa beforan biscepe his gewitnesse & his wed aleoge, gebete mid CXX scillingum.\n\u00d0eofas we hata\u00f0 o\u00f0 VII men; from VII hlo\u00f0 o\u00f0 XXXV; si\u00f0\u00f0an bi\u00f0 here.\nSe \u00f0e hlo\u00fee betygen sie, geswicne se hine be CXX hida o\u00f0\u00f0e swa bete.\nSe \u00f0e hereteama betygen sie, he hine be his wergilde aliese o\u00f0\u00f0e be his were geswicne.\nSe a\u00f0 sceal bion healf be huslgengum.\n\u00deeof, si\u00f0\u00f0an he bi\u00f0 on cyninges bende, nah he \u00fea swicne.\nSe \u00f0e \u00f0eof ofslih\u00f0, se mot gecy\u00f0an mid a\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine synnigne ofsloge, nalles \u00f0a gegildan.\nSe \u00f0e forstolen fl\u00e6sc finde\u00f0 & gedyrne\u00f0, gif he dear, he mot mid a\u00f0e gecy\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he hit age; se \u00f0e hit\nCierlisc mon gif he oft betygen w\u00e6re, gif he \u00e6t si\u00f0estan sie gefongen, slea mon hond o\u00f0\u00f0e fot.\nCyninges geneat, gif his wer bi\u00f0 twelfhund scillinga, he mot swerian for syxtig hida, gif he bi\u00f0\nGif feorcund mon o\u00f0\u00f0e fremde butan wege geond wudu gonge & ne hrieme ne horn blawe, for \u00f0eof he\nGif mon \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6s ofsl\u00e6genan weres bidde, he mot gecy\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine for \u00f0eof ofsloge, nalles \u00fe\u00e6s\nGif he hit \u00f0onne dierne\u00f0, & weor\u00f0e\u00f0 ymb long yppe, \u00f0onne ryme\u00f0 he \u00f0am deadan to \u00f0am a\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t\nGif \u00f0in geneat stalie & losie \u00f0e, gif \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe byrgean, mana \u00feone \u00fe\u00e6s angyldes; gif he n\u00e6bbe, gyld \u00f0u\nGif mon el\u00f0eodigne ofslea, se cyning ah tw\u00e6dne d\u00e6l weres, \u00feriddan d\u00e6l sunu o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6gas.\nGif he \u00f0onne m\u00e6gleas sie, healf kyninge, healf se gesi\u00f0.\nGif hit \u00f0onne abbod sie o\u00f0\u00f0e abbodesse, d\u00e6len on \u00fea ilcan wisan wi\u00f0 \u00feone kyning.\nWealh gafolgelda CXX scillinga his sunu C, \u00f0eowne LX, somhwelcne fiftegum; Weales hyd\nGif wite\u00f0eow Engliscmon hine forstalie, ho hine mon & ne gylde his hlaforde.\nGif hine mon ofslea, ne gylde hine mon his m\u00e6gum, gif hie hine on XII mon\u00f0um ne aliesden.\nWealh, gif he hafa\u00f0 V hida, he bi\u00f0 syxhynde.\nGif ciepemon uppe on folce ceapie, do \u00fe\u00e6t beforan gewitnessum.\nGif \u00f0iefefioh mon \u00e6t ciepan befo, & he hit n\u00e6bbe beforan godum weotum geceapod, gecy\u00f0e hit be\nTo fundes cildes fostre, \u00f0y forman geare geselle VI scillinga, \u00f0y \u00e6fterran XII, \u00f0y \u00f0riddan XXX, si\u00f0\u00f0an\nSe \u00f0e dearnenga bearn gestriene\u00f0 & gehile\u00f0, nah se his dea\u00f0es wer, ac his hlaford & se cyning.\nSe \u00f0eof gefeh\u00f0, ah X scillinga, & se cyning \u00f0one \u00f0eof; & \u00fea m\u00e6gas him swerian a\u00f0as unf\u00e6h\u00f0a.\nGif he \u00f0onne o\u00f0ierne & orige weor\u00f0e, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 he wites scyldig.\nGif he onsacan wille, do he \u00f0\u00e6t be \u00f0am feo & be \u00f0am wite.\nGif mon sweordes onl\u00e6ne o\u00f0res esne, & he losie, gielde he hine \u00f0riddan d\u00e6le; gif mon spere selle,\nGif mon cierliscne monnan fliemanfeorme teo, be his agnum were geladige he hine; gif he ne m\u00e6ge,\nGif mon wif gebyccge, & sio gyft for\u00f0 ne cume, agife \u00fe\u00e6t feoh & forgielde & gebete \u00feam byrgean, swa\nGif Wilisc mon h\u00e6bbe hide londes, his wer bi\u00f0 CXX scillinga; gif he \u00feonne healfes h\u00e6bbe, LXXX\nCyninges horswealh, se \u00f0e him m\u00e6ge ge\u00e6rendian, \u00f0\u00e6s wergield bi\u00f0 CC scillinga.\nSe \u00f0e on \u00f0\u00e6re fore w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t mon monnan ofsloge, getriewe hine \u00f0\u00e6s sleges & \u00f0a fore gebete be \u00f0\u00e6s\nSe \u00f0e \u00f0eof slih\u00f0, he mot a\u00f0e gecy\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine fleondne for \u00f0eof sloge, & \u00fe\u00e6s deadan m\u00e6gas him\nGif he hit \u00feonne dierne, & sie eft yppe, \u00feonne forgielde he hine.\nGif mon to \u00feam men feoh geteme, \u00f0e his \u00e6r o\u00f0swaren h\u00e6fde & eft o\u00f0swerian wille, o\u00f0swerige be\nSe \u00f0e \u00f0eof gefeh\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e him mon gefongenne agif\u00f0, & he hine \u00feonne al\u00e6te, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fea \u00f0ief\u00f0e gedierne,\nGif he ealdormon sie, \u00f0olie his scire, buton him kyning arian wille.\nSe cirlisca mon, se \u00f0e oft betygen w\u00e6re \u00f0ief\u00f0e, & \u00feonne \u00e6t si\u00f0estan synnigne gefo in ceape o\u00f0\u00f0e elles\nGif ceorl & his wif bearn h\u00e6bben gem\u00e6ne, & fere se ceorl for\u00f0, h\u00e6bbe sio modor hire bearn & fede:\nGif hwa fare unaliefed fram his hlaforde o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00f0re scire hine bestele, & hine mon geahsige, fare \u00fe\u00e6r\nCeorles wor\u00f0ig sceal beon wintres & sumeres betyned; gif he bi\u00f0 untyne\u00f0, & rec\u00f0 his neahgebures ceap\nBorges mon mot o\u00f0sacan, gif he wat, \u00fe\u00e6t he ryht de\u00f0.\nGif ceorlas g\u00e6rstun h\u00e6bben gem\u00e6nne o\u00f0\u00f0e o\u00feer gedalland to tynanne, & h\u00e6bben sume getyned hiora\nAbidden him \u00e6t \u00feam ceape swylc ryht swylce hit kyn sie.\nGif \u00feonne hry\u00f0era hwelc sie \u00fee hegas brece & ga in gehw\u00e6r, & se hit nolde gehealdan, se hit age\n\u00d0onne mon beam on wuda forb\u00e6rne, & weor\u00f0e yppe on \u00feone \u00f0e hit dyde, gielde he fulwite: geselle LX\nGif mon afelle on wuda wel monega treowa, & wyr\u00f0 eft undierne, forgielde III treowu \u00e6lc mid XXX\nGif mon \u00feonne aceorfe an treow, \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ge XXX swina undergestandan, & wyr\u00f0 undierne, geselle LX\nGafolhwitel sceal bion \u00e6t hiwisce VI p\u00e6ninga weor\u00f0.\nBurgbryce mon sceal betan CXX scillinga kyninges & biscepes, \u00fe\u00e6r his rice bi\u00f0; ealdormonnes LXXX\n\u00d0onne mon monnan betyh\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he ceap forstele o\u00f0\u00f0e forstolenne gefeormie, \u00feonne sceal he be LX\nGif \u00f0onne Englisc onstal ga for\u00f0, onsace \u00feonne be twyfealdum; gif hit \u00f0onne bi\u00f0 Wilisc onstal, ne bi\u00f0\n\u00c6lc mon mot onsacan frym\u00fee & werf\u00e6h\u00f0e, gif he m\u00e6g o\u00f0\u00f0e dear.\nGif mon forstolenne ceap befeh\u00f0, ne mot hine mon tieman to \u00f0eowum men.\nGif hwelc mon bi\u00f0 wite\u00f0eow niwan ge\u00f0eowad, & hine mon betyh\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe \u00e6r ge\u00f0iefed, \u00e6r hine\nGif mon on his m\u00e6stenne unaliefed swin gemete, genime \u00feonne VI scillinga weor\u00f0 wed.\nGif hie \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6ren oftor \u00feonne \u00e6ne, geselle scilling se agenfrigea & gecy\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6r oftor\nGif hi \u00f0\u00e6r tuwa w\u00e6ren, geselle twegen scillinga.\nGif mon nime \u00e6fesne on swynum: \u00e6t \u00feryfingrum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0ridde, \u00e6t twyfingrum \u00fe\u00e6t feor\u00f0e, \u00e6t \u00feymelum\nGif gesi\u00f0cund mon \u00feinga\u00f0 wi\u00f0 cyning o\u00f0\u00f0e wi\u00f0 kyninges ealdormonnan for his inhiwan o\u00f0\u00f0e wi\u00f0 his\nGif gesi\u00f0cund mon landagende forsitte fierd, geselle CXX scillinga & \u00f0olie his landes; unlandagende\nSe \u00f0e diernum ge\u00f0ingum betygen sie, geswicne hine be CXX hida \u00feara ge\u00f0ingea o\u00f0\u00f0e CXX scillinga\nGif mon forstolenne man befo \u00e6t o\u00ferum, & sie sio hand o\u00f0cwolen, sio hine sealde \u00feam men \u00fee hine\n\u00deonne h\u00e6f\u00f0 he \u00fe\u00e6t wite afylled mid \u00fey a\u00f0e, agife \u00feam agendfrio \u00feone monnan.\nGif he \u00feonne wite, hwa \u00f0\u00e6s deadan ierfe h\u00e6bbe, tieme \u00feonne to \u00feam ierfe & bidde \u00f0a hond \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe \u00fee bi\u00f0 werf\u00e6h\u00f0e betogen & he onsacan wille \u00fe\u00e6s sleges mid a\u00f0e, \u00feonne sceal bion on \u00fe\u00e6re\nGif hine mon gilt, \u00feonne mot he gesellan on \u00feara hyndenna gehwelcere monnan & byrnan & sweord\nWite\u00f0eowne monnan Wyliscne mon sceal bedrifan be XII hidum swa \u00f0eowne to swingum, Engliscne\nEwo bi\u00f0 mid hire giunge sceape scilling weor\u00f0 o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t XII niht ofer eastran.\nGif mon hwelcne ceap gebyg\u00f0 & he \u00f0onne onfinde him hwelc unh\u00e6lo on binnan XXX nihta, \u00feonne\nGif ceorl ceap forstil\u00f0 & bire\u00f0 into his \u00e6rne, & befeh\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6rinne mon, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 se his d\u00e6l synnig butan\nOxan horn bi\u00f0 X p\u00e6ninga weor\u00f0.\nCuuhorn bi\u00f0 twegea p\u00e6ninga; oxan t\u00e6gl bi\u00f0 scillinga weor\u00f0, cus bi\u00f0 fifa; oxan eage bi\u00f0 V p\u00e6ninga\nMon sceal simle to beregafole agifan \u00e6t anum wyrhtan VI w\u00e6ga.\nSe ceorl se \u00f0e h\u00e6f\u00f0 o\u00f0res geoht ahyrod, gif he h\u00e6bbe ealle on fo\u00f0re to agifanne, gesceawige mon, agife\nCiricsceat mon sceal agifan to \u00feam healme & to \u00feam heor\u00f0e, \u00fee se mon on bi\u00f0 to middum wintra.\n\u00deonne mon bi\u00f0 tyhtlan betygen, & hine mon bedrife\u00f0 to ceape, nah \u00feonne self nane wiht to gesellanne\n\u00deonne g\u00e6\u00f0 o\u00f0er mon, sele\u00f0 his ceap fore, swa he \u00feonne ge\u00feingian m\u00e6ge, on \u00f0a r\u00e6denne, \u00fee he him ga\n\u00deonne betyh\u00f0 hine mon eft o\u00fere si\u00f0e & bedrif\u00f0 to ceape.\nGif hine for\u00f0 nele forstandan se \u00f0e him \u00e6r ceap foresealde, & he hine \u00feonne forfeh\u00f0, \u00feolige \u00feonne his\nGif gesi\u00f0cund mon fare, \u00feonne mot he habban his gerefan mid him & his smi\u00f0 & his cildfestran.\nSe \u00f0e h\u00e6f\u00f0 XX hida, se sceal t\u00e6cnan XII hida gesettes landes, \u00feonne he faran wille.\nSe \u00f0e h\u00e6f\u00f0 X hida, se sceal t\u00e6cnan VI hida gesettes landes.\nSe \u00f0e h\u00e6bbe \u00fereora hida, t\u00e6cne o\u00feres healfes.\nGif mon ge\u00feinga\u00f0 gyrde landes o\u00fe\u00fee mare to r\u00e6degafole & geere\u00f0, gif se hlaford him wile \u00fe\u00e6t land\nGif mon gesi\u00f0cundne monnan adrife, fordrife \u00fey botle, n\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6re setene.\nSceap sceal gongan mid his fliese o\u00f0 midne sumor; o\u00f0\u00f0e gilde \u00fe\u00e6t flies mid twam p\u00e6ningum.\n\u00c6t twyhyndum were mon sceal sellan to monbote XXX scillinga, \u00e6t VI hyndum LXXX scillinga, \u00e6t\n\u00c6t X hidum to fostre X fata hunies, CCC hlafa, XII ambra Wilisc eala\u00f0, XXX hluttres, tu eald\nGif mon sie wertyhtlan betogen & he hit \u00feonne geondette beforan a\u00f0e & onsace \u00e6r, bide mon mid \u00fe\u00e6re\nGif mon wergild\u00f0eof gefeh\u00f0, & he losige \u00f0y d\u00e6ge \u00feam monnum \u00f0e hine gefo\u00f0, \u00feeah hine mon gefo\nGif hit bi\u00f0 niht eald \u00feief\u00f0, gebeten \u00fea \u00feone gylt \u00fee hine gefengon, swa hie ge\u00feingian m\u00e6gen wi\u00f0\nGif \u00f0eowwealh Engliscne monnan ofslih\u00f0, \u00feonne sceal se \u00f0e hine ah weorpan hine to honda hlaforde &\nGif he \u00feonne \u00feone ceap nelle foregesellan, \u00feonne mot hine se hlaford gefreogean; gielden si\u00f0\u00f0an his\nNe \u00feearf se frige mid \u00feam \u00feeowan m\u00e6g gieldan, buton he him wille f\u00e6h\u00f0e of aceapian, ne se \u00feeowa\nGif mon ceap befeh\u00fe forstolenne, & sio hond tiem\u00f0 \u00feonne, sio hine mon \u00e6tbefeh\u00fe, to o\u00ferum men, gif\nGif hwa o\u00f0res godsunu slea o\u00f0\u00f0e his godf\u00e6der, sie sio m\u00e6gbot & sio manbot gelic; weaxe sio bot be\nGif hit \u00feonne kyninges godsunu sie, bete be his were \u00feam cyninge swa ilce swa \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00fee.\nGif he \u00feonne on \u00feone geonbyrde \u00fee hine slog, \u00feonne \u00e6tfealle sio bot \u00fe\u00e6m godf\u00e6der, swa ilce swa\nGif hit biscepsunu sie, sie be healfum \u00feam.",
